      "html": "<article class=\"ds-card\"><div class=\"ds-top\"><span class=\"ds-rank\">1</span><div><h3>PeterMD</h3><span class=\"ds-tag2\">Lowest first-year cost</span></div><div class=\"ds-cost\"><span class=\"ds-lbl\">First-year cost</span><b>$1,548</b><span class=\"ds-lbl\">$129/mo avg</span></div></div><ul class=\"ds-inc\"><li><i><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m6 12.5 4 4 8-9\"/></svg></i>Medication included</li><li class=\"unk\"><i><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M9.5 9.5a2.5 2.5 0 1 1 3.3 2.4c-.5.2-.8.7-.8 1.2V14\"/><path d=\"M12 17.5v.01\"/></svg></i>Labs: not stated</li></ul></article>",
